&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery &amp;amp; Value Alignment.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead discovery sessions to understand customer goals and challenges. Articulate LaunchDarkly’s core use cases and demonstrate the value of our usage-based pricing model.&lt;/li&gt;
