&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecasting &amp;amp; Reporting.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain accurate data in Salesforce and sales tools. Provide consistent, reliable forecasting on a weekly and monthly basis. Meet or exceed quarterly revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
