&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5989&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c5f646010c60&quot;&gt;Lead and develop a team of engineers, providing coaching, feedback, and career growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5989&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c5f646010c60&quot;&gt;Partner with PM and Design to scope, estimate, and sequence roadmap items, making scope tradeoffs in real time.&lt;/li&gt;
