&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;LaunchDarkly is looking for an experienced, self-directed Sales Development Representative to own the first stage of engagement across EMEA. You will manage and qualify inbound leads, event MQLs, and accounts showing meaningful engagement through our account-based programs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a purely reactive lead-response role. You will combine fast, consultative follow-up with thoughtful, proactive outreach to turn customer interest and buying signals into qualified meetings and pipeline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the first point of contact for prospective customers across EMEA, creating a fast, thoughtful, and credible first impression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond rapidly to high-intent inbound inquiries, including demo requests, pricing requests, trials, contact forms, and other hand-raisers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own follow-up for event leads, adapting outreach based on the person, account, and engagement history.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and proactively engage targeted accounts that show meaningful engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Convert qualified interest into sales-ready meetings and opportunities for Account Executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute coordinated outreach across phone, email, LinkedIn, and other approved channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain complete, accurate, and timely activity, qualification notes, and account context in Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with EMEA Account Executives and with Marketing, Revenue Operations, and the global SDR organization to improve lead quality, routing, messaging, and conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share patterns and feedback from prospects so the broader team can improve campaigns, events, content, and the customer journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 1 year of successful SDR or BDR experience in B2B SaaS or a similar environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated record of setting goals, taking ownership, and delivering measurable results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience communicating with customers, prospects, or other external audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgment and the ability to operate independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal English, with the confidence to engage senior and technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
