&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3243&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a24ee1771d77&quot;&gt;Software powers the world, and LaunchDarkly empowers teams to deliver and control it safely. As a &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Senior Backend Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; on the &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Billing&lt;/strong&gt; team, you will own the systems that turn every plan, price, entitlement, and usage limit into revenue — checkout, subscription and entitlement APIs, usage metering, and the integrations to our billing, CRM, and finance systems. When billing is wrong, customers get the wrong product and we invoice the wrong amount. Correctness here is a commitment to our customers, not a nice-to-have.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3768&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1751ad35e602&quot;&gt;You and your team will drive the modernization of our billing platform. Technologies include Go, TypeScript, Postgres, AWS, and Terraform. Exact tool match matters far less than deep backend judgment and a track record of safely changing systems that are not allowed to be wrong.&lt;/p&gt;
