&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4069&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7bb177988742&quot;&gt;Design and build the systems that define our plans, pricing, entitlements, and limits, and expose them through our API.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4192&quot; data-local-id=&quot;efe94d12ab54&quot;&gt;Decompose billing from our monolith into services that are correct, testable, and independently deployable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4303&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8084d8437293&quot;&gt;Own correctness end to end — usage metering, reconciliation, and the invoices and usage data customers see.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
