&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9265&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5da7ee3c2597&quot;&gt;Experience with infrastructure-as-code tools such as Terraform or equivalent, and observability tools such as Datadog, New Relic, or equivalent.&lt;/p&gt;
