&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9413&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3b27928e4653&quot;&gt;A strong ownership mindset for production systems, including maintainability, testing, operational excellence, code quality, collaboration, and clear technical communication.&lt;/p&gt;
