&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4514&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9f8c574861e0&quot;&gt;LaunchDarkly is seeking a Senior Backend Engineer to join our Experimentation team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4599&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2dc3ef27e5ec&quot;&gt;The Experimentation team is building one of the company’s most strategic product areas: a platform that helps leading engineering organizations move beyond intuition and make product decisions with real statistical confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4827&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3197b7f77314&quot;&gt;Sitting at the intersection of large-scale systems, data science, and user experience, the team is creating a best-in-class experimentation product that lets customers set up, manage, and analyze experiments with ease while still earning the trust of even the most rigorous data teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5114&quot; data-local-id=&quot;64b1a1bf87b4&quot;&gt;From warehouse-native analysis to experimentation workflows built on top of LaunchDarkly’s massive feature management scale, this team is tackling ambitious technical problems with visible customer impact and a clear opportunity to define the future of modern software experimentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5401&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b785e3aad567&quot;&gt;As a Senior Backend Engineer, you will design and operate the services that power this product, contribute to technical direction, and help deliver new functionality to customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5582&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4b885099e893&quot;&gt;You will work closely with product managers, designers, data scientists, and engineers across LaunchDarkly to solve complex, data-intensive problems with meaningful customer impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and operate scalable backend services and APIs that power LaunchDarkly’s Experimentation product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own backend components across their lifecycle, including technical discovery, design, implementation, testing, deployment, monitoring, incident response, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve systems supporting experiment setup, event data ingestion, metric computation, results processing, and results presentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to architectural decisions and technical proposals, making thoughtful trade-offs around scalability, reliability, performance, cost, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product managers, designers, data scientists, and adjacent engineering teams to translate customer needs and product goals into reliable technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Data Platform, Warehouse Integrations, SDK, and other teams on shared data flows, services, and cross-team dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate complex production issues, identify root causes, and implement durable fixes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve observability, testing, deployment safety, operational processes, and the reliability of the systems you build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the team’s on-call rotation and take ownership of production systems in a you-build-it-you-run-it culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support teammates through thoughtful code reviews, design reviews, knowledge sharing, and informal mentorship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;6+ years of professional software engineering experience, including significant experience building and operating backend services in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Fluency using AI tools in software engineering workflows, including the judgment to direct, evaluate, and validate AI-generated output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7475&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f51347f276fc&quot;&gt;Experience designing and delivering customer-facing systems that are scalable, reliable, observable, and maintainable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7597&quot; data-local-id=&quot;44a8bf08588e&quot;&gt;Strong programming experience in Go or a comparable backend language such as Python, Rust, or C++. Our team is using Go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7721&quot; data-local-id=&quot;15e15a445699&quot;&gt;Experience with distributed systems, event-driven architectures, data pipelines, APIs, data modeling, or data-intensive services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7854&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b20e97175d73&quot;&gt;Familiarity with analytical, operational, or warehouse data stores such as ClickHouse, Postgres, Snowflake, Redshift, BigQuery, Databricks, or equivalent technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
