&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3893&quot; data-local-id=&quot;15dfabb57ac9&quot;&gt;This is added headcount on a growing team. You will work on the next generation of the flag-delivery architecture, streaming rollouts, and reliability and scale hardening. Our stack is Go, AWS, Terraform, and Datadog, but exact tool match matters less than deep backend expertise and a track record of owning production systems.&lt;/p&gt;
