&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equally strong as a technical educator and a systems builder&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated to replace manual work with scalable, AI-driven solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured thinker who brings clarity to complex, ambiguous problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and effective at working across teams without formal authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven innovator who experiments early and scales what works&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
