&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in a SaaS technical GTM role (e.g., Solutions Engineering, Solutions Architecture, Technical Sales, or Enablement)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering technical training and enablement programs for field teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building AI-driven tools, agents, or automations with real-world usage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical fluency, including the ability to read and debug code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern AI tooling (e.g., Relevance AI, Claude, LangChain)&lt;/li&gt;
